# Web agent skills

Before writing or editing files under `apps/web`, read
`.cursor/skills/showzy-web/SKILL.md` and `apps/web/AGENTS.md`. Skills are
advisory: this rule, ADRs, and `apps/web/AGENTS.md` win. Do not follow
vendored advice to use Next.js App Router, NativeWind, Zustand, raw
`fetch`, or to hand-edit `src/routeTree.gen.ts`.
